        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_python.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5420bd51-d42f-4457-ae1b-8269c4154918).Image",
        "Description": "Five simple kills that can all look like accidents. These people were in the wrong place at the wrong time... for them. But for you it&apos;s some easy kills to get a challenge done. Don&apos;t forget to wear the Fortune Teller disguise. Do the set up with the Handyman disguise then switch. Happy hunting!",
